From e80e7817dfb1da2d06f8339fe38e4c6fba8eb720 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 17:29:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] oneplus-instantnoodlep: enable sensors

- firmware-oneplus-instantnoodlep: new subpackage -hexagonfs with the
  files hexagonrpcd serves to the sensor DSP (sdsp libraries, sensor
  configs, the sensor registry). textrels is needed for two of the
  Hexagon libraries.
- device-oneplus-instantnoodlep: depend on hexagonrpcd and the
  -hexagonfs/-slpi firmware, run hexagonrpcd-sdsp with a writable
  registry in /var/lib/hexagonrpcd (seeded by tmpfiles), and set the
  accelerometer mount matrix for iio-sensor-proxy.

Tested with Phosh: automatic screen rotation works in all four
orientations. Light and proximity sensors are reported by libssc;
the magnetometer is not working yet.

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
---
